acking link but no tracking number in its text.\n\nCaveat on “recently”: that’s about five weeks before today (27 Oct), and nothing newer has arrived — the mailbox’s latest message is dated **26 Sep**, and there’s no delivery-confirmation or courier email after the 23 Sep shipment notice. So A-42 is the only shipped order on record, and its current delivery status isn’t confirmed in your mail."}','assistant','v2','2026-10-27T01:21:23.272Z','7f765568-8c0d-56ce-8b89-105126fefedf');
