ing the UPS tracking link for current status."}],"createdAt":1793064222783},{"type":"text","text":"**Tracking: shipped via UPS, not confirmed delivered.**\n\nFrom the order A-42 thread in **ana@harness.test** (Acme Store shipment card):\n\n- **Tracking number:** `1Z999AA10123456784` — UPS — track at https://acme.test/track/1Z999AA10123456784\n- **Status:** *shipped*; **deliveredAt:** none recorded\n- **Expected delivery:** **30 Sep 2026, 20:00 UTC** — for the *Walnut desk lamp*\n\nThe situation in short: the last and only update is the 23 Sep \"on its way\" notice. No delivery confirmation, courier update or later email has arrived in any mailbox since — the shipment card still reads *shipped* with an empty delivered timestamp, and the expected date passed about four weeks ago. So your mail can''t tell you whether it arrived, is delayed, or was lost; the tracking link above is the only live source.","createdAt":1793064222783}],"metadata":{"modelId":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor","provider":"openai-compatible.chat"},"content":"**Tracking: shipped via UPS, not confirmed delivered.**\n\nFrom the order A-42 thread in **ana@harness.test** (Acme Store shipment card):\n\n- **Tracking number:** `1Z999AA10123456784` — UPS — track at https://acme.test/track/1Z999AA10123456784\n- **Status:** *shipped*; **deliveredAt:** none recorded\n- **Expected delivery:** **30 Sep 2026, 20:00 UTC** — for the *Walnut desk lamp*\n\nThe situation in short: the last and only update is the 23 Sep \"on its way\" notice. No delivery confirmation, courier update or later email has arrived in any mailbox since — the shipment card still reads *shipped* with an empty delivered timestamp, and the expected date passed about four weeks ago. So your mail can''t tell you whether it arrived, is delayed, or was lost; the tracking link above is the only live source."}','assistant','v2','2026-10-27T01:22:44.820Z','7f765568-8c0d-56ce-8b89-105126fefedf');
