ending invitations** to follow up on (you''re the only member — Ana Silva, owner).\n\nWant me to draft the Raj Mehta follow-up, or bulk-archive the Sep 10 edge-case emails? Either is a single approval away."}','assistant','v2','2026-10-27T01:33:05.777Z','7f765568-8c0d-56ce-8b89-105126fefedf');
