text":"Here''s a paste-ready version:\n\n---\n\n**Weekly status — week of Oct 26**\n\nInbox is quiet: 0 unread and nothing new since Sep 26, so no mail waiting on me.\n\nSchedule: daily standup 09:00 UTC Tue–Fri. No other meetings on the calendar this week.\n\nOpen items:\n- Raj Mehta''s rebrand review (Oct 8) has passed with no follow-up — checking in on next steps.\n- A cluster of bulk deadline/invoice/contract entries sits on the Bulk calendar for Sunday Nov 1 — confirming which are real.\n- Housekeeping: ~100 edge-case test emails from Sep 10 queued for archiving.\n\nNo blockers.\n\n---\n\nWant a shorter one-liner version, or should I adjust the tone (more formal / more casual)?","createdAt":1793064858543}],"content":"Here''s a paste-ready version:\n\n---\n\n**Weekly status — week of Oct 26**\n\nInbox is quiet: 0 unread and nothing new since Sep 26, so no mail waiting on me.\n\nSchedule: daily standup 09:00 UTC Tue–Fri. No other meetings on the calendar this week.\n\nOpen items:\n- Raj Mehta''s rebrand review (Oct 8) has passed with no follow-up — checking in on next steps.\n- A cluster of bulk deadline/invoice/contract entries sits on the Bulk calendar for Sunday Nov 1 — confirming which are real.\n- Housekeeping: ~100 edge-case test emails from Sep 10 queued for archiving.\n\nNo blockers.\n\n---\n\nWant a shorter one-liner version, or should I adjust the tone (more formal / more casual)?","metadata":{"modelId":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor","provider":"openai-compatible.chat"}}','assistant','v2','2026-10-27T01:34:18.543Z','7f765568-8c0d-56ce-8b89-105126fefedf');
